  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Aid Match 2013&#x2013;2016: giving the public a say in how a portion of the aid budget is spent</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UK Aid Match allows the UK public to have a say in how an element of the aid budget is spent. DFID will match fund, pound for pound, public donations to appeals made by selected not-for-profit organisations, enabling them to increase their poverty reduction and development work in DFID priority countries.</narrative>
  </description>
